Package: EcoPhyloSim
Type: Package
Title: Analysis of Phylogenetic and Biogeographic Patterns, Inferring Species
    Community Assembly
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: c(person("Paul", "Bauche", role = "aut"),
    person("Florian", "Hartig", email = "florian.hartig@biologie.uni-regensburg.de", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment=c(ORCID="0000-0002-6255-9059")),
    person("Christian", "Buschbeck", role = "ctb"),
    person("Stefan", "Paul", role = "ctb"),
    person("Arseny", "Kapoulkine", role = c("ctb", "cph"), comment = "Author of the included pugixml library"),
    person("Kristen", "Wegner", role = "cph", comment = "Author of the pugxml library on which pugixml is based"))
Description: Simulates and analyzes species community
    assembly processes. It allows the user to implement different mechanisms of
    community assembly such as environmental filtering, competitive exclusion or
    dispersal limitation. These mechanisms can be combined or activated separately,
    which allows the user to identify biogeographic or phylogenetic patterns
    exclusively correlated with a certain mechanism or combination of mechanisms.
